      "Here’s a **clean, no-confusion breakdown** 👇  \n(so you can explain it to anyone — kids, elders, or interviews)\n\nimage_group{\"query\":[\"eagle bird soaring\",\"vulture bird feeding carcass\",\"black kite milvus migrans flying\",\"eagle vulture kite comparison\"]}\n\n## 🦅 Eagle vs 🦃 Vulture vs 🪁 Kite\n\n### 1️⃣ **Eagle**\n- **What it eats:** Live prey (fish, snakes, rabbits, birds)\n- **Hunting style:** Powerful hunter\n- **Beak & claws:** Very strong, sharp talons\n- **Flight:** Soars high, then dives fast\n- **Size:** Large, muscular\n- **Example:** entity[\"animal\",\"Golden Eagle\",\"raptor species\"]\n\n👉 **Role in nature:** Top predator (king-level hunter)\n\n---\n\n### 2️⃣ **Vulture**\n- **What it eats:** Dead animals (carcasses)\n- **Hunting style:** Does **not** hunt\n- **Beak & claws:** Beak strong, claws weak\n- **Flight:** Long slow circling, rides hot air\n- **Size:** Very large wingspan\n- **Example:** entity[\"animal\",\"Indian Vulture\",\"gyps indicus\"]\n\n👉 **Role in nature:** Cleaner / sanitation worker  \n(Removes dead bodies → prevents disease)\n\n---\n\n### 3️⃣ **Kite (Valluru)**\n- **What it eats:** Small prey + leftovers + scraps\n- **Hunting style:** Opportunistic (smart scavenger-hunter mix)\n- **Beak & claws:** Moderate strength\n- **Flight:** Smooth gliding, forked tail\n- **Size:** Medium\n- **Example:** entity[\"animal\",\"Black Kite\",\"milvus migrans\"]\n\n👉 **Role in nature:** Street-smart survivor (city & village bird)\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 One-line memory trick\n- **Eagle** → *Power & hunting*  \n- **Vulture** → *Cleaning the dead*  \n- **Kite (Valluru)** → *Smart glider, eats anything available*\n\n---\n\n## Tamil clarity (very useful 👌)\n- **Kalugu** = Eagle 🦅  \n- **Kazhugu** = Vulture 🦃  \n- **Valluru** = Kite 🪁  \n\nAll three belong to the **same family** (*Accipitridae*),  \nbut **their jobs in nature are totally different**.\n\nIf you want, I can:\n- give a **simple kid-level explanation**\n- show **tail / beak differences to identify instantly**\n- explain **why vultures disappeared in India**"
